== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Barbarian Warrior, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: 'Welcome. Bring this note to [[Kylan O'Danos]], and he will train you in the ways of the Warrior. You find him at the Pit of Doom.'

Upon handing him the tattered note:

: [[Kylan O'Danos]] says, 'Greetin's! We are the mighty Wolves o' the North, protectors o' Halas, and we must work hard t' keep it safe fer our citizens. Here is our tunic, it identifies ye as a proud warrior o' this great city. Let's get started with yer training, then, shall we?'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standings with [[Rogues of the White Rose]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[Shadowed Men]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[Merchants of Halas]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[Steel Warriors]] got better.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Patched Fur Tunic*]]. Good luck, Warrior!

